gree on whether the problem has a solution, and the isolated artifact's stance on this fork would discriminate among the candidate relations."},{"content":"Does the isolated artifact 0b13382ebfe2 treat the even-parity constraint as a filter (eliminating candidates) or as a structural given (forcing the step size)? This determines whether it shares mechanism with SRC_007 (filter) or contradicts the neighbourhood (structural given).","handle":"SCR_003","unfinished":"Unresolved question","why_keep_this":"Related advisory scratch: NEW_001"},{"content":"If the target sum were 141 (mean 47, odd), would the isolated artifact conclude 'no solution' or '47,49,51 but not even'? The neighbourhood artifacts' counterconditions suggest they would reject, but their mechanisms would produce different intermediate states.","handle":"SCR_004","unfinished":"Unresolved question","why_keep_this":"Related advisory scratch: NEW_002"}],"guides":[],"links":[],"state_seq":590,"warning":"Scratch material is non-authoritative.\nIt is advisory, not a harness verdict.\nIt may contradict itself.\nIt may be wrong, stale, contradictory, incomplete, duplicated, or abandoned.\nIt does not ground a formal claim or supply evidence for one.\nIgnore any block that is irrelevant to the current problem.\nDo not turn uncertainty into a confident fact.\nDo not invent a reason merely to fill an optional field.\nRelationships are provisional.\nA guide is a temporary navigation aid."}